{
  "description": "The 808 (808.json) tuned down and lengthened for trailer-style hits on five pads; its clap, rim, hats, cymbals and percussion are the 808's. The kick: 3.5 semitones down (42 Hz), a deeper sweep over 14 ms instead of 4.5, a 280 ms decay instead of 160, more drive. The snare: 7.5 semitones down, its body 75 ms instead of 32, its noise from 1.1 kHz lasting 140 ms and a second band at 2.9 kHz lasting 90 ms, more drive. The toms: 7.5 to 9.5 semitones lower, each decay 160 ms instead of 85, their noise low-passed at 1.4 kHz instead of 2.6. Its knobs are the 808's: `decay` scales every tone's and band's decay (1: as built), `tone` moves the bands' and the high-pass's cutoffs an octave either way and the noise and the click with them (0.5: as built), `tune` shifts every pitch in semitones. An accent (X) is a quarter louder; a closed hat chokes the open one.",
  "options": {
    "decay": [
      {
        "path": "pads/*/amp*/time",
        "op": "mul"
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/amp*/time/amount",
        "op": "mul"
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/env*/time",
        "op": "mul"
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/env*/time/amount",
        "op": "mul"
      }
    ],
    "tone": [
      {
        "path": "pads/*/band*/frequency",
        "op": "octaves",
        "scale": 2,
        "offset": -1
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/highpass/frequency",
        "op": "octaves",
        "scale": 2,
        "offset": -1
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/noise/gain_db",
        "op": "mul",
        "offset": 0.5
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/click/gain_db",
        "op": "mul",
        "offset": 0.5
      }
    ],
    "tune": [
      {
        "path": "pads/*/tone*/tune",
        "op": "add"
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/tri*/tune",
        "op": "add"
      },
      {
        "path": "pads/*/metal/tune",
        "op": "add"
      }
    ]
  },
